---
---

<section class="philosophy" id="about">
  <div class="philosophy__inner">
    <div class="philosophy__head">
      <p class="section-label philosophy__eyebrow">// THE PHILOSOPHY</p>
      <h2 class="philosophy__heading">
        You didn&rsquo;t start your business to build yourself.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="philosophy__desc-row">
      <p class="philosophy__desc">
        I help women entrepreneurs grow revenue with strategy and systems that
        protect their energy, so the business funds your life, not the other way
        around.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .philosophy {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 7.5em var(--container-padding) 5em; /* 120 / 80 */
    background-color: var(--color-bg-soft-cream);
  }

  .philosophy__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5em; /* 24px */
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 82em; /* 1312px */
  }

  .philosophy__head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1em; /* 16px */
    max-width: 47.19em; /* 755px */
  }

  .philosophy__eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .philosophy__heading {
    font-size: 5em; /* 80px */
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -3.2px;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .philosophy__desc-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .philosophy__desc {
    /* em max-width resolves against THIS element's font-size (32px), so 753px = 23.53em */
    max-width: 23.53em; /* 753px */
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 2em; /* 32px */
    line-height: 1.125; /* 36/32 */
    letter-spacing: -0.32px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    text-indent: 3.375em; /* 108px @32 */
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
    .philosophy__heading {
      font-size: 3.5em; /* 56px */
    }
    .philosophy__desc {
      font-size: 1.75em;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
    .philosophy {
      padding-block: 2em; /* 32px */
    }
    .philosophy__inner {
      gap: 2.5em; /* 40px */
    }
    .philosophy__heading {
      font-size: 2.5em; /* 40px */
      letter-spacing: -1.6px;
    }
    .philosophy__desc {
      max-width: 18em;
      font-size: 0.875em; /* 14px */
      line-height: 1.428;
      letter-spacing: -0.28px;
      text-indent: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
